然后拿起毛细管，把样品点到板上。

54
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:43,060
On the corresponding dot, briefly tap the tip of the microcapillary tube.
在对应的点上，用微量毛细管的尖端轻轻点一下。

55
00:03:43,060 --> 00:03:47,120
Do this about three times, but make sure you do it gently so that you don't scratch
这样点三次左右，但一定要轻，以免刮伤

56
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,620
the silica layer.
硅胶层。

57
00:03:48,620 --> 00:03:53,920
You also want a small sample to maximize the resolution, do not let the sample spread out
你还要让样品点小一些，以获得最佳分辨率，不要让样品扩散

58
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,320
too much.
得太开。

59
