plate more slowly than nonpolar substances, which are unable to make these interactions.
比无法产生这些相互作用的非极性物质更慢。

79
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:27,220
Be sure to monitor the chamber, since we don't want the solvent front to get all
一定要注意观察展开缸，因为我们不希望溶剂前沿一直

